  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NovaRain/Fallout-Sonora-English/zipball/1.16.4-sfall",
  "body": "This is a repack of Cambragol's [Fallout: Sonora - 1.16.4E](https://github.com/cambragol/Fallout-Sonora-English/releases/tag/1.16.4) that works with vanilla `Fallout2.exe` and [**sfall**](https://github.com/sfall-team/sfall).\r\n\r\nQuoted from Cambragol:\r\n> Fallout: Sonora version 1.16.4 English.\r\n>\r\n> Contains all updates from Nevada Band for 1.16.1a base and the DLC\r\n> Contains all merged changes from Fallout: Sonora version 1.16 English\r\n>\r\n> Fix for DLC robot black screen (FISSION-specific)\r\n> Removed old border for Dialog screen (FISSION-specific)\r\n>\r\n> See the log_develop.txt in the release for specific changes.\r\n\r\n**Installing a language pack:**\r\n1. Extract `fs_<language>.dat` to the \"**mods**\" folder.\r\n2. In `mods_order.txt`, remove the semicolon at the beginning of the line containing the language pack filename.\r\n   If there's no existing line, add the filename as a new line.\r\n3. In `fallout2.cfg`, change `language=english` to `language=<language>`.\r\n\r\n**Enabling the Bookseller mod:**\r\n* Uncomment the **fs_bookseller.dat** line in `mods_order.txt` by removing the semicolon at the beginning of the line.\r\n* Currently the Bookseller mod is only in English and Russian.\r\n\r\n**Notes:**\r\n* The Russian language pack `fs_russian.dat` includes only the original text files from Nevada Band release. It does not include the additional message lines introduced in the English version, so some text may still appear in English. You can check [ru_dialog_missing_list.txt](https://github.com/NovaRain/Fallout-Sonora-English/blob/eng_repack/Fallout_Sonora_1_15_E/mods/ru_dialog_missing_list.txt) and [ru_game_missing_list.txt](https://github.com/NovaRain/Fallout-Sonora-English/blob/eng_repack/Fallout_Sonora_1_15_E/mods/ru_game_missing_list.txt) if you like to translate those additional lines.\r\n* Unlike the previous version, this 1.16 repack _requires_ [**sfall**](https://github.com/sfall-team/sfall).",
